From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Demitri Nava <demitri@boltz.bio>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:04:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bes: read every requested target pattern

The sink trims a TargetPatterns event to 512 KiB, so a command whose argfile
names tens of thousands of targets lost all but the first few thousand from
its requested set, and their target events with them.

Keep the event whole for Bazel conversion, cap only the patterns the converter
reports, match requested labels through an index, and treat a list that was
still cut short as naming every target.
